    "description": "Administrator: SAP HANA, SAP NetWeaver, Solution Manager, Start date : 10/15/2026 End Date : 10/14/2027 Submission deadline : 10/22/2026 Client info: NCDOT Note: * Hybrid * Either Webcam Interview or In Person Description: **The candidate must currently live in NC. **The max rate for this position is $159.00/hour. NCDIT-T EBS is seeking an SAP System Administrator - Expert to serve as the SAP HANA subject matter expert for the enterprise SAP landscape that runs the systems of record for NCDOT and NCDMV. The contractor will administer and support more than 100 production and non-production SAP HANA databases; provide SAP Basis expertise across all SAP products used by EBS; coordinate and implement technical changes, patches, and upgrades; participate in the duty manager on-call rotation and daily system checks; and support the in-flight migration of the EBS landscape to SAP NS2 (S/4HANA Cloud, Private Edition). The ideal candidate has deep hands-on SAP HANA administration experience at enterprise scale - including System Replication, performance tuning, backup and recovery, and upgrade and migration work - combined with broad SAP NetWeaver Basis administration across both ABAP and Java stacks, and is comfortable owning production availability in a large, heavily integrated public sector landscape. * Key Responsibilities: • Provides technical expertise across all SAP products used by EBS • HANA SME for 100+ databases • Coordinate and implement technical changes and enhancements to SAP systems • Operational support on our duty manager on call rotation • Morning systems check and reporting status • Assigned basis liaison on EBS Solution Manager problem messages • Execute HANA System Replication, refreshes, and system copies supporting the migration to SAP NS2 • Apply HANA revisions, SAP kernel updates, and support package stacks across the S/D/Q/P landscape • Monitor database performance and capacity and remediate issues beforethey affect availability * Preferred: • SAP Certified Technology Associate - SAP HANA (e.g. C_HANATEC) or equivalent HANA certification • SAP Certified Technology Associate - System Administration (SAPNetWeaver / OS-DB) • Experience with SAP RISE, SAP NS2, or S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition migrations • Experience with SAP Solution Manager (technical monitoring, ChaRM)and/or SAP Focused Run • Experience running SAP landscapes on AWS, including AWS Gov Cloud • Experience supporting SAP in a public sector or FedRAMP/Gov RAMP-regulated environment • Experience with SAP integration to Open Text document management • Experience with SAP BW on HANA, SAP CRM, GRC/Access Control, or Enterprise Portal",
