    "description": "Consultant: State Government Experience., Solution Architecture, Administartion Skill, ALM GitHub CDC CJIS Start date: 11/18/2026 End Date : 12 Months from projected start date Submission deadline: 10/14/2026 5:00:00 PM Client Info: DPH Note: *Interview Process: 1 Round of Virtual Interviews *Work Location: Hybrid. 4 Days Remote and 1 Day Onsite per Week. *Candidate location: Candidate must be a CURRENT SC resident. No relocation allowed. Description: Company / Department culture (why do you enjoy working for the company – selling points for potential candidates): The South Carolina Department of Public Health (SCDPH) is committed to protecting, promoting, and improving the health and well-being of everyone in South Carolina. With more than 3,400 employees in 70 offices statewide, SCDPH is home to a diverse team of professionals who are leaders in their fields and share a passion for making a meaningful difference. As the states public health agency, SCDPH has a long-standing legacy of attracting and retaining talented individuals who want to build rewarding and impactful careers that directly improve the lives of South Carolinians every day. Guided by its mission, SCDPH works to ensure that individuals, families, and communities across the state have the resources, access, and support needed to achieve better health outcomes. Examples of SCDPHs community impact include: • Coordinating statewide disease prevention programs that reduce the spread of infectious illnesses. • Supporting maternal and child health initiatives that help families thrive. • Improving access to high-quality healthcare services, especially in underserved communities. • Providing public health education and emergency preparedness guidance to keep residents informed and protected. • Collaborating with local partners to strengthen community health systems and promote healthier living environments. Candidates should be self-motivated, team-oriented, capable of working under limited supervision, and responsive to priority tasks. They must also excel at forming productive working relationships with individuals from diverse backgrounds and at all organizational levels. Why is this position open (new role, increased work load, new dept, resignation, promotion)? The role is available as the previous contractor has fulfilled the maximum contract duration of 36 months. This ensures adherence to state guidelines and provides an opportunity for new candidates to apply. Scope of the project: The South Carolina Department of Public Health is undertaking a statewide modernization of its digital health systems, requiring additional staff to support a complex network of interconnected services and cloud-based workloads. As a Microsoft Government GCC tenant, the agency leverages Dynamics 365 and Power Platform to deliver secure, scalable, and compliant enterprise solutions. The Enterprise Program Manager will be responsible for ensuring all systems follow industry best practices, meet strategic and regulatory requirements, and maintain business continuity. Key responsibilities include implementing Zero Trust security principles, managing role-based access controls, establishing secure configuration baselines, and performing continuous monitoring aligned with government cloud standards. This position is integral to supporting both project-specific and operational needs, contributing to the agencys mission of improving health outcomes for South Carolina residents. Success will be measured by the delivery of robust solutions, compliance with security protocols, and effective collaboration across teams. Pre-employment Checks (drug, credit, criminal, motor vehicle)? • Credit che",
