    "description": "Analyst: Browser Based Application, Automated System Builds, Help Desk Environment, Start date : 10/5/2026 End Date : 10/04/2027 Submission deadline : 10/06/2026 Client Info : NCDHHS-NCFAST Note: * Work Arrangement: Hybrid * Agency Interview Type: Webcam Interview Only Description: The primary purpose of the Configuration Analyst is to assist with provisioning and troubleshooting user accounts/issues associated with North Carolina Identity Management (NCID) in production and training environments for PATH NC. This position will assist users with understanding multi faction authentication (MFA) and assist with confirming each user has successfully enrolled in MFA. This position works closely with state and county systems administrators via the Service Now (SNOW) ticketing system. In addition, this position will assist with granting access to users so they can export reports from PATH NC. Skills Ability to research, analyze and interpret automated system issues Ability to communicate clearly and concisely in oral and written form with staff at all levels using excellent telephone etiquette and skills.",
