    "description": "• Systems Administrator – Security Responsible for administering, securing, maintaining, and optimizing enterprise infrastructure across on-premises, virtualized, hybrid, and cloud environments. Focuses on vulnerability management, remediation, patch compliance, and security across Windows, Linux, VMware, and cloud platforms. Experience with Tanium or similar tools is a plus. \n\nKey Responsibilities \n\n• Infrastructure Security: Administer Windows, Linux, VMware, and cloud infrastructure. Implement security baselines, access controls, and hardening standards. \n• Vulnerability Management: Identify, prioritize, track, and remediate vulnerabilities across servers, virtual machines, and cloud resources. Validate fixes and coordinate remediation timelines. \n• Patching: Coordinate OS and infrastructure patching, validate deployments, maintain compliance, and minimize disruption. \n• Security & Compliance: Assess configurations against security standards, correct weaknesses, and support audits and compliance reporting. \n• Cloud & Virtualization: Secure and maintain VMware, virtual machines, cloud services, configurations, and access controls across hybrid environments. \n• Security Tools: Support asset discovery, endpoint management, vulnerability assessment, patching, and remediation using Tanium or similar platforms. \n• Automation: Develop PowerShell, Bash, or Python scripts and workflows to automate patching, remediation, security validation, and reporting. \n• Troubleshooting: Resolve infrastructure, configuration, patching, and security issues. Maintain incident and change records in the IT service management system. \n• Documentation & Collaboration: Document configurations, security standards, patching, and remediation procedures. \n\nEnvironment\t\n\n• Works in a hybrid enterprise environment spanning on-premises, virtualization, and cloud infrastructure, focusing on vulnerability management, security, hardening, and remediation. \nRequired Experience:\n•  Infrastructure: Windows Server, Linux, troubleshooting, access management, storage, networking, identity, and endpoint systems. \n• Security: Vulnerability scanning, remediation tracking, patching, risk prioritization, and configuration compliance. \n• Virtualization/Cloud: VMware vSphere, virtual machines, and cloud platforms. \n• Tools/Automation: Endpoint management, asset discovery, Tanium or similar tools, PowerShell, Bash, Python, Ansible, and Terraform. \n• Operations: Incident/change management, documentation, reporting, and cross-team collaboration.",
    "rawDescription": "<p></p><ul><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">Systems Administrator – Security Responsible for administering, securing, maintaining, and optimizing enterprise infrastructure across on-premises, virtualized, hybrid, and cloud environments. Focuses on vulnerability management, remediation, patch compliance, and security across Windows, Linux, VMware, and cloud platforms. Experience with Tanium or similar tools is a plus.&nbsp;</span></font></li></ul><p></p><p><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\"><b>Key Responsibilities&nbsp;</b></span></font></p><p></p><ul><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">Infrastructure Security: Administer Windows, Linux, VMware, and cloud infrastructure. Implement security baselines, access controls, and hardening standards.&nbsp;</span></font></li><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">Vulnerability Management: Identify, prioritize, track, and remediate vulnerabilities across servers, virtual machines, and cloud resources. Validate fixes and coordinate remediation timelines.&nbsp;</span></font></li><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">Patching: Coordinate OS and infrastructure patching, validate deployments, maintain compliance, and minimize disruption.&nbsp;</span></font></li><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">Security &amp; Compliance: Assess configurations against security standards, correct weaknesses, and support audits and compliance reporting.&nbsp;</span></font></li><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">Cloud &amp; Virtualization: Secure and maintain VMware, virtual machines, cloud services, configurations, and access controls across hybrid environments.&nbsp;</span></font></li><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">Security Tools: Support asset discovery, endpoint management, vulnerability assessment, patching, and remediation using Tanium or similar platforms.&nbsp;</span></font></li><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">Automation: Develop PowerShell, Bash, or Python scripts and workflows to automate patching, remediation, security validation, and reporting.&nbsp;</span></font></li><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">Troubleshooting: Resolve infrastructure, configuration, patching, and security issues. Maintain incident and change records in the IT service management system.&nbsp;</span></font></li><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">Documentation &amp; Collaboration: Document configurations, security standards, patching, and remediation procedures.&nbsp;</span></font></li></ul><p></p><p><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\"><b>Environment<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></b></span></font></p><p></p><ul><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">Works in a hybrid enterprise environment spanning on-premises, virtualization, and cloud infrastructure, focusing on vulnerability management, security, hardening, and remediation.&nbsp;</span></font></li></ul><b style=\"font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;\">Required Experience:</b><br><ul><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">&nbsp;Infrastructure: Windows Server, Linux, troubleshooting, access management, storage, networking, identity, and endpoint systems.&nbsp;</span></font></li><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">Security: Vulnerability scanning, remediation tracking, patching, risk prioritization, and configuration compliance.&nbsp;</span></font></li><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">Virtualization/Cloud: VMware vSphere, virtual machines, and cloud platforms.&nbsp;</span></font></li><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">Tools/Automation: Endpoint management, asset discovery, Tanium or similar tools, PowerShell, Bash, Python, Ansible, and Terraform.&nbsp;</span></font></li><li><font face=\"verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">Operations: Incident/change management, documentation, reporting, and cross-team collaboration.</span></font></li></ul><p></p>",
