    "description": "• The Client is seeking a mid-level Business Analyst to lead requirements gathering, analyze business processes, and support solution delivery. \n• Must have strong analytical skills, experience with Azure DevOps or similar tools, and excellent communication abilities. Agile experience and SQL knowledge preferred.\n\nResponsibilities\n\nRequirements Analysis & Documentation\n\n•\tLead requirements elicitation sessions with business stakeholders and technical teams.\n\n•\tAnalyze and document business processes, workflows, and system interactions.\n\n•\tDevelop detailed business requirements, functional specifications, user stories, and acceptance criteria.\n\n•\tEnsure requirements are clear, complete, and traceable throughout the project lifecycle.\n\nSolution Design & Validation\n\n•\tCollaborate with architects and developers to ensure solutions align with business needs.\n\n•\tSupport testing activities by creating test cases, validating functionality, and coordinating user acceptance testing (UAT).\n\n•\tIdentify gaps, risks, and dependencies; propose mitigation strategies.\n\nStakeholder Engagement\n\n•\tAct as a primary point of contact for business units during project execution.\n\n•\tFacilitate workshops, demos, and status meetings to ensure alignment and transparency.\n\n•\tCommunicate effectively with technical and non-technical audiences.\n\nProcess Improvement & Mentorship\n\n•\tRecommend process improvements and automation opportunities.\n\n•\tMentor junior Business Analysts and share best practices.\n\n•\tContribute to standards and templates for documentation and requirements management.\n\nSkills Required:\n\n• Experience as a Business Analyst or similar role\tRequired\t5\tYears\n\n• Strong understanding of business process modeling, requirements elicitation techniques, and documentation standards.\tRequired\t\t\n\n• Proficiency with tools such as Microsoft Office, Visio, and requirements management platforms (e.g., Azure DevOps, Jira).\tRequired\t\t\n\n• Excellent analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills.\tRequired\t\t\n\n• Experience in Agile/Scrum environments; familiarity with writing user stories and acceptance criteria.\tRequired\t\t\n\n• Knowledge of SQL for data analysis and validation.\tRequired\t\t\n\n• Exposure to Azure DevOps for backlog management and traceability.\tRequired",
