    "htmlDescription": "<p></p><ul><li>Consultant responsible for conducting risk assessments for new software requests and renewals, documenting findings in OneTrust, and ensuring proper workflow integration with ServiceNow and Ohio Buys.</li></ul><p></p><p><b>Key Responsibilities:</b></p><p></p><ul><li>Perform cybersecurity risk assessments for software procurement and renewals.</li><li>Enter and manage risk assessment data in OneTrust and ServiceNow.</li><li>Provide comments and documentation for Ohio Buys requisitions as required.</li><li>Collaborate with business units, procurement, and IT groups to clarify requirements and process steps.</li><li>Support process mapping and improvement initiatives to reduce workflow duplication.</li><li>Track and report metrics on workload, turnaround times, and resource needs.</li></ul><p></p><p><b>Skills Required:</b></p><p></p><ul><li>Experience with cybersecurity risk assessment and third-party risk tools (e.g., OneTrust<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li><li>Familiarity with IT procurement workflows and platforms (ServiceNow, Ohio Buys).<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li><li>Strong documentation and communication skills.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li><li>Ability to work collaboratively across departments and manage multiple requests.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li><li>The position may require rapid iteration and adaptation as processes evolve.<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></li></ul><p></p><p></p>",
