    "description": "Key Responsibilities• Manage operational data, trackers, reports, and dashboards using MS Excel.\n• Support Power BI, SharePoint, Power Automate, Python, Copilot/GenAI, and other automation initiatives.\n• Track tasks, timelines, SLAs, and operational deliverables.\n• Perform data validation, quality checks, and QA/QC activities.\n• Coordinate with global stakeholders and manage multiple priorities.\n• Identify process gaps and support process improvement and automation initiatives.\nMust-Have• Bachelor’s degree in Engineering, Business, Insurance, Analytics, or related field.\n• 1+ years of experience in Operations, Shared Services, Insurance/Underwriting Support, Risk Engineering Support, or similar roles.\n• Strong MS Excel and analytical skills.\n• Knowledge of Power BI / SharePoint / Power Automate / Python / Copilot or GenAI.\n• Strong communication, problem-solving, and attention-to-detail skills.\nGood to Have• Exposure to Commercial Insurance / Risk Engineering / Underwriting.\n• Experience in data quality, QA/QC, process improvement, or automation.\n• Experience working with global stakeholders.",
