    "description": "Training Officer Position Summary:\n\nThe Client is seeking three qualified and passionate individuals for the role of Training Officer. This position is responsible for developing and delivering training on C-FIRST, Tennessee’s Comprehensive Child Welfare Information System to client's staff. The ideal candidate will have training experience in this system and a working knowledge of training computer systems as well as a strong background in training delivery. This position is hybrid located in Memphis, Nashville, and Knoxville.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n\n• Deliver C-FIRST training to client's employees, covering the range of C-FIRST application modules and tasks specific to varying roles within the system both in-person and virtually.  \n• Develop training materials for specialized tasks in C-FIRST.\n• Generate data within the C-FIRST training sandbox for use in C-FIRST training. \n• Collaborate with subject matter experts from the Department of Children’s Services and Deloitte to enhance training development and delivery. \n• Provide web-based technical assistance to staff to facilitate system learning. \n• Utilize Microsoft Teams and other digital platforms to conduct and support training sessions\n• Collaborate with training team members and program leadership to ensure consistency and quality in training content and delivery\n• Travel will be required within the State of TN.\n Minimum Qualifications:\n\n• One (1) year of experience in training delivery, adult education, or staff development\n• Proficiency in Microsoft Teams and other virtual training tools\n• Strong communication, facilitation, and organizational skills\n• Ability to work independently and collaboratively in a fast-paced, evolving training environment\n• Bachelor's Degree is required\nPreferred Qualifications:\n\n• Experience delivering training in a government or human services setting\n• Experience training computer systems\n• Microsoft Excel - (1-3 Years)\n• Microsoft PowerPoint - (1-3 Years)\n• Microsoft Word - (1-3 Years)\nWork Conditions:\n\n• Travel may be required for in-person training sessions\n• Hybrid work environment with both remote and on-site responsibilities",
    "rawDescription": "<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">Training Officer Position Summary:</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:\">The Client is seeking three qualified and passionate individuals for the role of <strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">Training Officer.</strong> This position is responsible for developing and delivering training on C-FIRST, Tennessee’s Comprehensive Child Welfare Information System to client's staff. The ideal candidate will have training experience in this system and a working knowledge of training computer systems as well as a strong background in training delivery. This position is hybrid located in Memphis, Nashville, and Knoxville.</p><div align=\"center\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"1\" width=\"768\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 0px; margin-top: 17px; margin-bottom: 17px; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; border-color: rgb(238, 238, 238) currentcolor currentcolor; width: 8in\"></div><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">Key Responsibilities:</strong></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 8.5px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:\"><li>Deliver <strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">C-FIRST </strong>training to client's employees, covering the range of C-FIRST application modules and tasks specific to varying roles within the system both in-person and virtually.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>Develop training materials for specialized tasks in C-FIRST.</li><li>Generate data within the C-FIRST training sandbox for use in C-FIRST training.&nbsp;</li><li>Collaborate with subject matter experts from the Department of Children’s Services and Deloitte to enhance training development and delivery.&nbsp;</li><li>Provide web-based technical assistance to staff to facilitate system learning.&nbsp;</li><li>Utilize <strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">Microsoft Teams</strong> and other digital platforms to conduct and support training sessions</li><li>Collaborate with training team members and program leadership to ensure consistency and quality in training content and delivery</li><li><strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">Travel</strong> will be required within the State of TN.</li></ul><div align=\"center\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"1\" width=\"768\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 0px; margin-top: 17px; margin-bottom: 17px; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; border-color: rgb(238, 238, 238) currentcolor currentcolor; width: 8in\"></div><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">&nbsp;Minimum Qualifications:</strong></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 8.5px;\"><li style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">One (1) year</strong> of experience in <strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">training delivery</strong>, adult education, or staff development</li><li style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Proficiency in <strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">Microsoft Teams</strong> and other virtual training tools</li><li style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Strong communication, facilitation, and organizational skills</li><li style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Ability to work independently and collaboratively in a fast-paced, evolving training environment</li><li style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Bachelor's Degree is required</li></ul><div align=\"center\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"1\" width=\"768\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 0px; margin-top: 17px; margin-bottom: 17px; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; border-color: rgb(238, 238, 238) currentcolor currentcolor; width: 8in\"></div><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">Preferred Qualifications:</strong></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 8.5px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:\"><li>Experience delivering training in a <strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">government or human services setting</strong></li></ul><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 8.5px;\"><li style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Experience training computer systems</li><li style=\"\"><font color=\"#333333\">Microsoft Excel - (1-3 Years)</font></li><li style=\"\"><font color=\"#333333\">Microsoft PowerPoint - (1-3 Years)</font></li><li style=\"\"><font color=\"#333333\">Microsoft Word - (1-3 Years)</font></li></ul><div align=\"center\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"1\" width=\"768\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 0px; margin-top: 17px; margin-bottom: 17px; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; border-color: rgb(238, 238, 238) currentcolor currentcolor; width: 8in\"></div><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8.5px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold\">Work Conditions:</strong></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 8.5px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:\"><li>Travel may be required for in-person training sessions</li><li>Hybrid work environment with both remote and on-site responsibilities</li></ul>",
