    "description": "• This request is for a Technical Specialist who will server as a mainframe expert. \n• The ideal candidate should have mainframe skills including CICS, DB2, Elixir, Endevor,IMS, and JCL. Additional skills in middleware and MQ are beneficial. \n\nThe candidate should possess\n\n•  Thorough knowledge of Z/OS operating system and its interrelationships and functionality\n•  The ability to provide configuration management /release management support and guidance for Endevor software\n•  Thorough knowledge of SQL (Structured Query Language) programming language and techniques\n•  Thorough knowledge of tools and utilities to support DB2\n•  The ability to evaluate complex SQL queries and recommend suggestions for better software performance and cost savings\n•  The ability to provide CICS administration, problem-solving and debugging support interfacing with application developers as well as personnel\n\nSkill Required:\n\n• Knowledge of Z/OS operating system and its interrelationships and functionality\tRequired\t7\tYears\n• Experience providing configuration management / release management support and guidance for Endevor software\tRequired\t7\tYears\n• Knowledge of SQL (Structured Query Language) programming language and techniques\tRequired\t7\tYears\n• Knowledge of tools and utilities to support DB2\tRequired\t7\tYears\n• Ability to evaluate complex SQL queries\tRequired\t7\tYears",
