    "description": "• The Senior Budget Officer serves as the dedicated financial operations lead for the Health Information Exchange Authority (HIEA), ensuring accurate, compliant, and timely management of complex financial workflows across multiple IT systems and IT agencies. \n• This position oversees the full lifecycle of invoice tracking, documentation management, budget monitoring, and cross agency financial coordination. The Senior Budget Officer maintains structured financial documentation across multiple platforms, ensures timely and accurate processing of invoices, develops and updates dynamic budget dashboards, and monitors spending across major contracts and funding streams.\n• The role serves as HIEA’s primary financial coordination point with the Client, DHB Finance, legal, privacy, security, procurement, contractors, and partner agencies, ensuring that all submissions—financial, contractual, and compliance related—are accurate, complete, and on schedule. The Senior Budget Officer proactively identifies and resolves financial issues, maintains standardized SOPs, and provides transparent financial reporting that supports leadership decision making to strengthen adherence to state, federal, and contractual compliance requirements, and ensure that HIEA’s financial operations function reliably and efficiently.\n\nSkills Required:\n\n• Experience managing financial aspects of healthcare IT programs\tRequired\t7\tYears\n• Advanced Financial Operations & Budget Management\tRequired\t7\tYears\n• Multi-System Financial Documentation & Data Management\tRequired\t5\tYears\n• Cross-Agency Coordination & Compliance\tRequired\t5\tYears\n• Invoice Lifecycle Management & Vendor Coordination\tRequired\t5\tYears\n• Financial Analysis, Issue Resolution & Reporting\tRequired\t5\tYears",
    "rawDescription": "<p></p><ul><li>The Senior Budget Officer serves as the dedicated financial operations lead for the Health Information Exchange Authority (HIEA), ensuring accurate, compliant, and timely management of complex financial workflows across multiple IT systems and IT&nbsp;agencies.&nbsp;</li><li>This position oversees the full lifecycle of invoice tracking, documentation management, budget monitoring, and cross agency financial coordination. The Senior Budget Officer maintains structured financial documentation across multiple platforms, ensures timely and accurate processing of invoices, develops and updates dynamic budget dashboards, and monitors spending across major contracts and funding streams.</li><li>The role serves as HIEA’s primary financial coordination point with the Client, DHB Finance, legal, privacy, security, procurement, contractors, and partner agencies, ensuring that all submissions—financial, contractual, and compliance related—are accurate, complete, and on schedule. The Senior Budget Officer proactively identifies and resolves financial issues, maintains standardized SOPs, and provides transparent financial reporting that supports leadership decision making to strengthen adherence to state, federal, and contractual compliance requirements, and ensure that HIEA’s financial operations function reliably and efficiently.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><b>Skills Required:</b></p><p></p><ul><li>Experience managing financial aspects of healthcare IT programs<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>7<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li><li>Advanced Financial Operations &amp; Budget Management<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>7<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li><li>Multi-System Financial Documentation &amp; Data Management<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>5<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li><li>Cross-Agency Coordination &amp; Compliance<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>5<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li><li>Invoice Lifecycle Management &amp; Vendor Coordination<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>5<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li><li>Financial Analysis, Issue Resolution &amp; Reporting<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>5<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li></ul><p></p><p></p>",
    "htmlDescription": "<p></p><ul><li>The Senior Budget Officer serves as the dedicated financial operations lead for the Health Information Exchange Authority (HIEA), ensuring accurate, compliant, and timely management of complex financial workflows across multiple IT systems and IT&nbsp;agencies.&nbsp;</li><li>This position oversees the full lifecycle of invoice tracking, documentation management, budget monitoring, and cross agency financial coordination. The Senior Budget Officer maintains structured financial documentation across multiple platforms, ensures timely and accurate processing of invoices, develops and updates dynamic budget dashboards, and monitors spending across major contracts and funding streams.</li><li>The role serves as HIEA’s primary financial coordination point with the Client, DHB Finance, legal, privacy, security, procurement, contractors, and partner agencies, ensuring that all submissions—financial, contractual, and compliance related—are accurate, complete, and on schedule. The Senior Budget Officer proactively identifies and resolves financial issues, maintains standardized SOPs, and provides transparent financial reporting that supports leadership decision making to strengthen adherence to state, federal, and contractual compliance requirements, and ensure that HIEA’s financial operations function reliably and efficiently.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><b>Skills Required:</b></p><p></p><ul><li>Experience managing financial aspects of healthcare IT programs<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>7<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li><li>Advanced Financial Operations &amp; Budget Management<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>7<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li><li>Multi-System Financial Documentation &amp; Data Management<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>5<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li><li>Cross-Agency Coordination &amp; Compliance<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>5<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li><li>Invoice Lifecycle Management &amp; Vendor Coordination<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>5<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li><li>Financial Analysis, Issue Resolution &amp; Reporting<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Required<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>5<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Years</li></ul><p></p><p></p>",
