    "description": "• The Client is looking for a Senior AI Forward Deployed Engineer to build and deploy AI solutions that improve business processes and decision-making. \n• The candidate will work closely with business teams to understand their needs and deliver practical, production-ready AI solutions.\n\nKey Responsibilities\n\n• Design, build, and deploy end-to-end AI solutions.\n• Develop AI workflows using GPT, Claude, Azure OpenAI, and Microsoft Copilot.\n• Integrate AI into existing business tools and processes.\n• Work with stakeholders to understand requirements and deliver effective AI solutions.\n• Manage the complete project lifecycle, from planning and development to testing and deployment.\n• Ensure AI solutions are reliable, scalable, and deliver measurable business value.\n\nRequirements\n\n• Proven experience deploying AI solutions in production.\n• Hands-on experience with Large Language Models (LLMs) such as GPT, Claude, Azure OpenAI, or Microsoft Copilot.\n• Strong understanding of AI workflows and automation.\n• Ability to independently manage AI projects from design to deployment.\n• Good problem-solving, communication, and stakeholder management skills.\n\nPreferred\n\n• Experience with Azure AI services and cloud platforms.\n• Knowledge of AI agents, prompt engineering, or workflow automation tools.\n• Experience integrating AI with enterprise applications.",
