    "htmlDescription": "<p></p><ul><li>The Client is looking for a Senior AI Forward Deployed Engineer to build and deploy AI solutions that improve business processes and decision-making.&nbsp;</li><li>The candidate will work closely with business teams to understand their needs and deliver practical, production-ready AI solutions.</li></ul><p></p><p><b>Key Responsibilities</b></p><p></p><ul><li>Design, build, and deploy end-to-end AI solutions.</li><li>Develop AI workflows using GPT, Claude, Azure OpenAI, and Microsoft Copilot.</li><li>Integrate AI into existing business tools and processes.</li><li>Work with stakeholders to understand requirements and deliver effective AI solutions.</li><li>Manage the complete project lifecycle, from planning and development to testing and deployment.</li><li>Ensure AI solutions are reliable, scalable, and deliver measurable business value.</li></ul><p></p><p><b>Requirements</b></p><p></p><ul><li>Proven experience deploying AI solutions in production.</li><li>Hands-on experience with Large Language Models (LLMs) such as GPT, Claude, Azure OpenAI, or Microsoft Copilot.</li><li>Strong understanding of AI workflows and automation.</li><li>Ability to independently manage AI projects from design to deployment.</li><li>Good problem-solving, communication, and stakeholder management skills.</li></ul><p></p><p><b>Preferred</b></p><p></p><ul><li>Experience with Azure AI services and cloud platforms.</li><li>Knowledge of AI agents, prompt engineering, or workflow automation tools.</li><li>Experience integrating AI with enterprise applications.</li></ul><p></p><p><span data-teams=\"true\"><br></span></p>",
