    "description": "Role Overview\n\nWe are looking for a versatile Motion & Graphic Designer with strong command of Adobe Suite, solid graphic design skills, and working knowledge of Figma will be a plus. The ideal candidate can translate scripts and written ideas into engaging motion visuals and high quality static designs. Familiarity with Generative AI tools is considered an added advantage.\n\nKey Responsibilities • Produce motion graphics, animations, and video content based on creative briefs.\n • Edit and refine video content using Adobe Premiere Pro and After Effects.\n • Design digital creatives, marketing graphics, and brand-aligned assets.\n • Build layouts, UI components, and visual mockups using Figma when required.\n • Collaborate with internal teams to deliver consistent and effective visual communication.\n • Use Generative AI tools to accelerate design and animation workflows.\nRequired Skills • 2+ years of experience\n • Proficiency in Adobe After Effects, Premiere Pro, Photoshop, Illustrator.\n • Strong motion design & graphic design capabilities.\n • Working knowledge of Figma (design systems, components, prototyping) will be an advantage.\n • Strong understanding of typography, layout principles, visual hierarchy, and color theory.\n • Ability to manage multiple design tasks with accuracy and attention to detail.\n • Knowledge of Generative AI tools for design and motion production.\n • Experience with 3D design tools (Blender, Cinema 4D) is a plus.\nCandidate Profile • Creative, detail oriented, and skilled in visual storytelling.\n • Capable of delivering polished outputs under deadlines.\n • Strong collaboration and communication skills.\n • Open to learning new tools, techniques, and workflows.",
